# __APP_NAME__

A [Pylair](https://github.com/PylairHQ/Pylair) app: a Tauri shell, a managed
bundled Python, and a typed bridge between them.

## Develop

```
npm install
uv sync
npx pylair dev
```

`pylair dev` supervises the Python runtime, hot-restarts it when
`backend/app.py` changes, and regenerates the typed client stubs on every
save.

## The typed bridge

`src/api.generated.ts` is **generated, ephemeral, and never committed** (it
is gitignored on purpose): `pylair dev` and `pylair build` both regenerate
it from the `@expose`d signatures in `backend/app.py`. Edit the Python
functions, not the stubs. Because it is regenerated, a fresh clone has no
copy of it - `pylair build` runs codegen before the frontend typecheck, so
nothing needs the file to exist beforehand.

## Build an installer

```
npx pylair build
```

`npx pylair doctor` diagnoses the environment any time.
